&lt;p&gt;而统计页面代码来自于&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606028773&quot; alt=&quot;M Element&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element&quot;  &gt;M Element&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3550607&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606028773&quot; alt=&quot;#ApmV&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3550607)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv&quot;  &gt;#ApmV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，其中&lt;span class=&quot;printuser&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apmv&quot;  &gt;#ApmV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的代码来自于&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3317001&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606028773&quot; alt=&quot;W Asriel&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3317001)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;W Asriel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，而后者又是从主站找来的代码。&lt;br /&gt;
